# bigleaf_maple_summer: a huge bigleaf maple in full August leaf
# (GAME_DESIGN 11.11): a thick bark trunk that runs up into the canopy and
# splits there into three great limbs, sprawling up-left, up and up-right,
# moss along their tops (where the light and the rain fall) and licorice
# ferns on them, the leaf clumps (maple_clump_*) heavy on the limbs, the
# limbs showing in the gaps between, a few short limb stubs reaching out
# past the clumps. Lit from the upper left. Its limbs leave the frame on
# the left; flipped, on the right. The anchor, 0,0, is the foot of the
# trunk. About 70 wide, 168 tall.
# the trunk and the limbs, bark, laid as strands along each
